      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so quiet. like, i used to live for the sound of the crowd and the rhythm of the floor, but now i'm just sitting in this apartment and i don't even recognize the person in the mirror. it feels like the athlete died months ago and i'm just... a ghost living in their house.",
